message: "If you use Aurora, please cite the article below."
title: "Aurora: structured neuroradiology reporting and score calculation"
type: software
version: "2.0"
url: "https://aurora-report.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/alexandraslrodrigues/aurora"
license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
abstract: >-
  Free, open-access web application for structured brain MRI reporting in
  cognitive and movement disorders: small vessel disease and atrophy report,
  visual rating scales (GCA, MTA, ERICA, Koedam), midbrain and pons measurements
  (MRPI, MRPI 2.0, midbrain/pons ratios, MCP width) and recommended MRI protocols.
keywords:
  - neuroradiology
  - structured reporting
  - MRI
  - dementia
  - parkinsonism
  - small vessel disease
